      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "summary",
          "text": "The Cluster Observability Operator is a Kubernetes operator which enables the management of Monitoring/Alerting stacks through Kubernetes CRDs.",
          "title": "Topic"
        },
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Cluster Observability Operator\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* coo-prometheus-container: go-retryablehttp: url might write sensitive information to log file [coo-0] (CVE-2024-6104)\n* coo-thanos-container: golang-protobuf: encoding/protojson, internal/encoding/json: infinite loop in protojson.Unmarshal when unmarshaling certain forms of invalid JSON [coo-0] (CVE-2024-24786)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS\nscore, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s)listed in the References section.",
